{"title":"RusczykCode","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>RusczykCode is a programming language made by Art of Problem Solvers! It's currently in the makings. RusczykCode is named after Richard Rusczyk, the founder of AoPS. The list of current developers are phi, StarFrost7, and banannas97.\n</p><p>Visit the forums for RusczykCode here: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c92978\">http://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c92978</a>\n</p><p><br />\n<i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=RusczykCode&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018105658\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.006 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.009 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 7/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 274/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.406      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    5.406      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:14274:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018105658 and revision id 191236. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}